# Public build-time configuration. Changes require a rebuild.
# Unset: /api during Vite development; offline-only in production builds.
# Use /api explicitly for the existing local preview proxy.
# An independent HTTPS read-only indexer may include a path prefix, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://indexer.example.com
# The app appends /vaults. Never add RPC URLs or credentials.
